 "notes": [
  "Table 10 (MAR50.68) as printed puts buckets 8 and 9 (HY/NR sovereign 2.0%, HY/NR local government 4.0%) in the row headed 'IG bucket'; the values follow the bucket numbers of Table 8 and are recorded by bucket number.",
  "Reference credit spread, equity and commodity buckets each have a single delta risk factor (MAR50.68(1), MAR50.72(1), MAR50.76(1)), so no within-bucket rho is needed for them; FX has one delta factor per currency bucket (MAR50.61(1)).",
  "The text gives no floor at zero under the square roots of MAR50.53; ruling KR-62."
 ]
